{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "f21dac6758da43e281a4c71ada2386cd0fe4c895d09dddcad53c0a61d7f6ca04", "ja": "奏 ～Melody～", "zh": "奏 ～Melody～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "caaf881079e32a40ee3e4da8e0a7cff3343aab1b34754be27eb794ec9fa565f0", "ja": "新曲披露から数日後。千早と静香は、公演の\nメンバー達と、打ち上げにカラオケにきてい\nた。誰が千早とデュエットするのかで揉めた\nりしつつも、全力で楽しんでいる一同に、プ\nロデューサーは延長を決めるのだった。", "zh": "新曲披露后的几天，千早和静香与公演的成员们一起来到卡拉OK庆祝演出结束。大家为了谁和千早合唱而争论不休，却依然尽情享受着欢乐时光。制作人见状，决定延长包间时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0041c2a0841ada261eababcfe78d8c4488cd930bdb2142e5f783232b1007b77f", "ja": "（客席を青く染め上げた、新曲披露公演から数日……。\n打ち上げに、みんなでやってきたのは……）", "zh": "（让观众席染上一片蓝色的新曲披露公演结束后，过了几天……\n大家一起来庆功宴的地方是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "4bc9992121b6db4292a92f52d7faea37746bcacf966d8e89bbc72829e7111e47", "ja": "……ふぅ。", "zh": "……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "8a2be8ed25f0d827d16f0b435644fd5b2acd78efa464b5115d3c87ae4023a14c", "ja": "イエーッ！\nよかったぜ、シズ！", "zh": "耶——！\n太好了，静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "b7082b595a2a8782fc79d365d23bbcd7e779b1cef6ff0c67efa738bada1e8d80", "ja": "いえーい！　静香さん、カッコよかったです♪\nですよね、志保さん？", "zh": "耶——！静香小姐，刚才帅呆了♪  \n对吧，志保小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "3ab5dd3c0a78d482b1da399c07df3a836e735a18b45642c7051e9ae06bebfbdc", "ja": "そうね、よかったわ。\n……あ、この曲にしようかな……。", "zh": "是啊，挺不错的。\n……啊，要不要就选这首歌呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "0f7463662416620015775336fc116490b849ce0ef313de30f735a202269ad182", "ja": "さすがね静香。\nきっと、すごい点数が出ると思う。", "zh": "不愧是静香。\n我想一定能拿到很高的分数。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "6ee0baa0ac42f51500e797e4f2bce97102dc3a6a05c78a621563300e39f760cb", "ja": "千早さん……あ、ありがとうございます！\nそ、そうなんです、私も手ごたえがあって……♪", "zh": "千早小姐……啊、谢谢您！\n是、是的，我也觉得这次很有把握……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1007_se", "source_sha256": "5b8e5dd019914722d52d847410b55d613db2a2a2a5f063d600b3da308d2b9844", "ja": "ジャジャーン！", "zh": "锵锵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "aa1469b347ee5b1cd62ff2de29e8238f3aa879a435e50999cc74f127a454b486", "ja": "おお……89点か。\nうん。シズ、ドンマイ！", "zh": "哦……89分啊。\n嗯。静，别在意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "1fb1eb57b8817790531a48b59eb4537c5571348d299e80dc0acc4b62c37c9da6", "ja": "もう～っ、今のでどうして90点越えないのっ！\nどうしてですか、{$P$}！", "zh": "真是的～！刚才那一下为什么没超过90分啊！为什么会这样，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7044888cfd1cec344be63331abb65221ee458e5daf2a4365d2efc95e67b76b31", "ja": "ど、どうしてだろうな……。\n今度メーカーの人に会ったら聞いてみるよ。いつか。", "zh": "我、我也不知道为什么……  \n下次见到厂商的人，我会问问看的。总有一天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "f2f5f06ad6ef5c911af8b6cc2a705d78716044c29542f279348b93cb327aea75", "ja": "納得いかない……。\n志保、ちょっとリモコン貸して！", "zh": "我无法接受……志保，把遥控器借我一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "365dc94927876b38b98a81a59fa44c8963cf5c29e696f02acb3797f0b0ac5ac6", "ja": "ちょ……、順番も守れないの？\n……子供。", "zh": "喂……连顺序都不会遵守吗？  \n……小孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "75346c23cc844ff471a01d48533e3a07e7126b6ac449c6a2bc170f21aab618a3", "ja": "し、志保がいつまでも選ばないからじゃない。\n……あ、わかった。さては自信ないんでしょう？", "zh": "是、是因为志保一直不选啊。\n……啊，我知道了。你该不会是没自信吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "b6a574c6d5d223855360a986dadec8d0176ef1cc739bc9824e98e42be8cc1af8", "ja": "……へえ、そういうこと言うの。\n思ってた以上ね。", "zh": "……哼，居然会说出这种话。\n比我想象的还要有种呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "ab360adc354835412e600d65da5395274c6f512c15c44aa34e7c248bdd439bb6", "ja": "あ、あの、あの……っ。\nわたし、お二人と一緒に歌いたいです！", "zh": "啊、那个，那个……！\n我想和两位一起唱歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "9bee4c5e48be4b577e54326e05612fe562efbfd2a44abcccc82f4b11f803606f", "ja": "あ……次、私が入れた曲ね。\nじつはデュオの曲で……。", "zh": "啊……下一首是我选的歌呢。\n其实是二重唱的歌曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "2279e8eceeb4a33cdd7b2688a1460f21d1c5b86b595965fab2c3c270e5f302ca", "ja": "え？　あ、コホン。\nじゃあ、ここはあらためて……。", "zh": "咦？啊，咳咳。\n那么，这里就重新来过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "3623ab29905717042d28a994192cc8bbc1a05a22c9b248f38b4db8cc073743dc", "ja": "あたしの出番だな！　シズはさっき歌っただろ？\nチハとのデュオにも、もう飽きただろうし。", "zh": "轮到我出场了吧！静香刚才已经唱过了对吧？\n和千早的二重唱，你也已经听腻了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "390ae2e31c20a3fb67db70c5d80d9bb2dec26f3984ea459494a5c05f67abc556", "ja": "な、なんてこというんですか！？\n飽きてませんっ！　全然足りませんっ！！", "zh": "你、你在说什么啊！？\n我才没有腻呢！完全不够！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "be1413a7d505633960128fd9827c599570a7d4c624f5829e9667d03d026be4dd", "ja": "じゃあ、星梨花がいいんじゃないですか。\nさっきも歌いたいって。", "zh": "那，让星梨花来不是正好吗？\n她刚才也说想唱歌来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "97434af0c1cf788a617634622302d3881abf8284cfc94b3aa091aa6442e41114", "ja": "えっ。で、でも、静香さんもジュリアさんも、\n歌いたいって……。", "zh": "诶？可、可是静香姐姐和茱莉亚先生也说想唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "39fe91032dbd896df3d7149c540afed9b38cee82864c3391aaab6bc293c7aa9b", "ja": "そういう志保は、本当にまだ歌ってないよな？\nそろそろどうだ？", "zh": "志保你真的还没唱过吧？差不多也该唱了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "208cdec8159079b7aa6a574c9cccfa6157f3d294487b8229bcb16bca2c51c271", "ja": "え……千早さんと……。", "zh": "呃……和千早小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "ab6447bed06d05e462e11c730ae1ad5c1329fcaf0f8849d621f91d32203d7104", "ja": "ダメっ！　ダメですっ！\nだったら{$P$}でいいです！", "zh": "不行！不行啦！那样的话用{$P$}就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "6fd20baed507ea127c4a471283487ecc541b99d74a7e486ac41664d08cfd9001", "ja": "……なにそれ？", "zh": "……那是什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "a8afd102edd87fd94714038eeab662605082abc219f6c1442d94f5b0e0c0309f", "ja": "まあ、そういえば俺も歌ってなかったか。\nよし！　じゃあ、そろそろ1曲いくか！", "zh": "这么说来，我好像也没唱过吧。\n好！那差不多该唱1首了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "1130df7d3237c98619c102bf637d595b9fcaae38146bf00b837e2d020ecd5231", "ja": "あの……すみません。\nできれば、アイドルの誰かと……。", "zh": "那个……不好意思。\n可以的话，能不能和某位偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "b787ed40b906548a2b9e5c81f3e84edd5cf407e04c0cd591e6db9098390798a5", "ja": "えっ……。なぜ……？", "zh": "诶……为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "748dada5bfac4015f7bb595a2cdcb1767a7cddfadd257770ae91e9e1353bbc7a", "ja": "その……。\nすみません、点数が！", "zh": "那个……\n对不起，分数！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "298e04ebb9c797e298ff78f6a6305cb280a5ead9f5eba62f9332dda17960b522", "ja": "狙ってたのか……。", "zh": "原来是故意瞄准的吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1032_002chi", "source_sha256": "b992d0768bf11b4bc45df5540e923ed5926eb7326d60fe6756444bf6f79f6b5f", "ja": "ち、違うの！　狙ってるとかじゃなくて、ただ、\nデュオではどれくらい出るのかな、って……！", "zh": "不、不是！不是我故意瞄准的，只是想知道，在双人组合里能发挥到什么程度……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "c1309e05e9610b0e44d027a2f4cb1fb74712ab11abba35d63738be62d488f2a2", "ja": "（狙ってたんだな……）", "zh": "（果然是有意的啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1034_002chi", "source_sha256": "40f6b7f2a232f7fada18d49d47dc759117ded48987da19f74b098747dc58f2d0", "ja": "でも……そうね、やっぱり最初は、\n静香と歌ってもいいかしら。", "zh": "不过……也是呢，果然一开始还是和静香一起唱，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "d7bb95549bd3616a40454ba1b24a89e43b05a48920cd82ecab9de0602662980e", "ja": "千早さん……！", "zh": "千早……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "fb79c5d0b793dccc8fc73ad23dc6d865f92f22cf97db96120ae9d472e2a02ea3", "ja": "あははっ、チハがいうなら仕方ない。\nそれに、じつはまた聴きたいって思ってたし？", "zh": "啊哈哈，既然千早都这么说了，那也没办法。\n而且，其实我也正想着还想再听一次呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1038_022ser", "source_sha256": "23aa8d3b5fea184577a4f4a5d00f1be815091c734f021982eee6e1f368060910", "ja": "わたしもです！　しかも、こんなに近くで、\n直接聴けるなんて……。えへへ、特等席ですね♪", "zh": "我也是！而且，能离这么近直接听到……嘿嘿，这可是特等席呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1039_033sih", "source_sha256": "a9906a98de4eb7f77fa96dfe14271b10117fd247425968cd21b7f1152f2dec71", "ja": "そうね。……静香、頑張って。\nまた自信なくされると星梨花が迷惑するから。", "zh": "是啊……静香，加油。\n要是你又失去自信，星梨花会很困扰的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "65d31035cb6ee651bab6ae35d4e55ee572397623bfcd3eedf4c43fd58da6a150", "ja": "し、志保さん……！？", "zh": "志、志保小姐……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "55fb280425e9e77e4d11659d80ea541bc04025e75d0b156734bbbe4021392f85", "ja": "……心配いらないわよ、星梨花。……志保もね。\n私……千早さんとなら、もう覚悟ができたから。", "zh": "……不用担心哦，星梨花。……志保也是。\n我……要是和千早小姐在一起，就已经做好觉悟了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1042_002chi", "source_sha256": "98b463e6a14e060785c969a2689855d2b88495e086b9b54265745fe145b493aa", "ja": "私もよ。……それじゃ行きましょうか。\n今日も、私の全部を……。", "zh": "我也是。……那么我们走吧。\n今天也要把我的全部……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "a99a6b995c32323200e984c8778748f1da4b959b48674d13727ea7a468b6ed17", "ja": "全部の私を……。", "zh": "将全部的我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1044_002chi", "source_sha256": "2ad332625db2c170df2c4db038c944b54cb6e17a91187502074c06445459139e", "ja": "全部、歌にのせて！", "zh": "全部寄托在歌声中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1045_015siz", "source_sha256": "2ad332625db2c170df2c4db038c944b54cb6e17a91187502074c06445459139e", "ja": "全部、歌にのせて！", "zh": "全部寄托在歌声中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
