{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0137_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0137_story_07_1047_p", "source_sha256": "2d6d10c8e60e852b58ae7f5c1e1263b0e39e218e4badc0c18a98df463ca69bf5", "ja": "（青く燃え盛る火を、これからも守るため……\n……カラオケも、延長するとしよう！）", "zh": "（为了今后也守护那团熊熊燃烧的蓝色火焰……\n……卡拉OK也继续唱下去吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
